            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>精確(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3162:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3162\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3162-TW</a>)19日12:22下跌5.9元，股價跌停報53.8元，委賣3,000張，成交1,110張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為鎔煉.鑄造.擠型.鍛造.CNC精密加工及裝配等生產及製造。汽車零配件.。電工零配件.機車零配件.自行車零配件.電腦零配件製造。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>精確(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3162:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3162\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3162-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌22.87%，櫃買市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌10.62%，短期股價無明顯表現。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-694 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-627 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-67 張</li> <li>融資增減：-283 張</li> <li>融券增減：+1 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
